    "title": "Terms &#038; Conditions",
    "html": "<h2>Terms of Service</h2><p><strong>These Terms of Service govern your use of PuffSticker.com and outline the rules, rights, and responsibilities between you and our business. By accessing our website or making a purchase, you agree to comply with these terms, which cover everything from product use and ordering policies to intellectual property rights and limitations of liability. Please read them carefully before using our site or placing an order.</strong></p><i></i><i></i><a>1. Overview</a><p>PuffSticker.com is operated by PuffSticker. Throughout the site, the terms “we”, “us”, and “our” refer to PuffSticker. We offer this website, including all information, tools, and services available from this site to you, the user, conditioned upon your acceptance of all terms, conditions, policies, and notices stated here.</p><i></i><i></i><a>2. Use of Website</a><p>By using this site, you affirm that you are at least the age of majority in your state or province of residence. You may not use our products for any illegal or unauthorized purpose.</p><p>You agree not to reproduce, duplicate, copy, sell, resell, or exploit any portion of the website or any contact on the website without express written permission from us.</p><i></i><i></i><a>3. Products and Services</a><p>We specialize in creating and selling custom made stickers and shopping bags. We reserve the right to limit the sales of our products or services to any person, geographic region, or jurisdiction. All product descriptions and pricing are subject to change at any time without notice.</p><i></i><i></i><a>4. Orders and Payments</a><p>We reserve the right to refuse any order you place with us. In the event that we make a change to or cancel an order, we may attempt to notify you via the email and/or billing address/phone number provided at the time the order was made.</p><p>Prices for our products are subject to change without notice. All payments must be made at the time of purchase. <strong>See Section 8 for our reprint and refund policy.</strong></p><i></i><i></i><a>5. Accuracy of Information</a><p>We are not responsible if information made available on this site is not accurate, complete, or current. The material on this site is provided for general information and should not be relied upon or used as the sole basis for making decisions.</p><i></i><i></i><a>6. Intellectual Property</a><p>All content on PuffSticker.com—including images, product designs, logos, and text—is the property of PuffSticker or its content suppliers and is protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws.</p><p>You may not use our content without express written permission.</p><i></i><i></i><a>7. Limitation of Liability</a><p>PuffSticker shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, punitive, or consequential damages arising from your use of our website or any products purchased through it.</p><i></i><i></i><a>8. Reprint and Return Policy</a><p>Because of the custom nature of our products, all sales are final. However, if your order arrives damaged, misprinted, or incorrect, <strong>you may be eligible for a free reprint or refund</strong> – see our <a href=\"/reprint-policy/\">Refund &amp; Return Policy</a> for details.</p><i></i><i></i><a>9. Third-Party Links</a><p>Certain content, products, and services available via our website may include materials from third parties. We are not responsible for examining or evaluating the content or accuracy and do not warrant any third-party materials or websites.</p><i></i><i></i><a>10. Termination</a><p>We reserve the right to terminate your access to the site and its services at our sole discretion, without notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users or our business interests.</p><i></i><i></i><a>11. Changes to Terms</a><p>We reserve the right to update, change, or replace any part of these Terms of Service by posting updates to our website. Your continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of those changes.</p><i></i><i></i><a>12. Contact Information</a><p>For questions about these Terms, please contact us at <strong><a href=\"mailto:sales@puffsticker.com\">sales@puffsticker.com</a></strong>, call <strong>(407) 923-4382</strong>, or visit our <a href=\"/contact-us/\">Contact Us page</a>.</p>",
