    "title": "Contact Us",
    "html": "<h2>Keep in touch with us</h2><h2>We’re talking about clean puffy sticker sheets, of course – and we’ve got a sample pack for yourself for only $45. </h2><i></i><h6>\n Address: </h6><p>Apt 325, 3433 Mission Bay Boulevard <br>Orlando, FL 32817\n<br>USA<br><br>\n1306 Meath Dr.\n<br>Oshawa, ON L1K 0M7\n<br>Canada\n</p><i></i><h6>\n Contact </h6><p>Hotline: <strong>(403) 923-4382</strong><br>\nE-mail: info@puffsticker.com</p><i></i><h6>\n Hour of operation </h6><p>Mon - Fri : 09:00 - 17:00 (EST)<br>\nSat &amp; Sun : Closed</p><h2>Send a message</h2><ul></ul>",
